1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:22,260
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is June sixth. Some big cultural news from Nara: a group of ancient palace and tomb sites called Asuka-Fujiwara looks set to become a World Heritage Site. A UNESCO advisory group has just recommended it for the list. Let's listen.

2
00:00:22,859 --> 00:00:25,620
[News] 今日のニュースです。

3
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:33,543
[News] 奈良県の「飛鳥・藤原の宮都」が、世界遺産になりそうです。

4
00:00:34,243 --> 00:00:42,404
[News] 6月6日、ユネスコの専門家のグループが、登録するように勧めました。

5
00:00:43,103 --> 00:00:48,624
[News] 飛鳥・藤原は、今の奈良県にあります。

6
00:00:49,323 --> 00:00:55,564
[News] 橿原市、桜井市、明日香村の三つの場所です。

7
00:00:56,264 --> 00:01:04,328
[News] 6世紀の終わりから8世紀の初めごろ、ここに天皇の宮殿がありました。

8
00:01:05,028 --> 00:01:09,420
[News] 当時、ここは日本の都でした。

9
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:18,951
[News] 飛鳥寺などの古いお寺の跡や、高松塚古墳などの古いお墓も残っています。

10
00:01:19,652 --> 00:01:25,724
[News] 全部で19の資産が、世界遺産の候補です。

11
00:01:26,424 --> 00:01:33,599
[News] 正式な登録は、7月に韓国のプサンで決まる見通しです。

12
00:01:34,299 --> 00:01:41,475
[News] 登録されれば、日本の世界遺産は全部で27件になります。

13
00:01:42,176 --> 00:01:47,936
[News] 地元の人たちは、「とてもうれしい」と話しています。

14
00:01:48,635 --> 00:01:50,268
[Host] Let's break it down.

15
00:01:50,867 --> 00:01:59,123
[Slow] 奈良県の「飛鳥・藤原の宮都」が、世界遺産になりそうです。

16
00:01:59,924 --> 00:02:04,843
[Host] Nara's Asuka-Fujiwara capital looks set to become a World Heritage Site.

17
00:02:05,444 --> 00:02:08,324
[Vocab] 世界遺産

18
00:02:08,723 --> 00:02:15,900
[Host] It means World Heritage Site — a place UNESCO judges so valuable it should be protected for everyone.

19
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:24,060
[Slow] ユネスコの専門家のグループが、登録するように勧めました。

20
00:02:24,860 --> 00:02:28,939
[Host] A group of UNESCO experts recommended that it be registered.

21
00:02:29,539 --> 00:02:31,867
[Vocab] 登録

22
00:02:32,268 --> 00:02:36,900
[Host] It means registration — formally entering something onto an official list.

23
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:46,740
[Slow] 6世紀の終わりから8世紀の初めごろ、ここに天皇の宮殿がありました。

24
00:02:47,539 --> 00:02:53,491
[Host] From the late sixth to the early eighth century, the emperor's palace stood here.

25
00:02:54,092 --> 00:02:56,300
[Vocab] 宮殿

26
00:02:56,699 --> 00:03:01,259
[Host] It means palace — the grand residence of an emperor or king.

27
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:06,876
[Slow] 当時、ここは日本の都でした。

28
00:03:07,675 --> 00:03:11,204
[Host] At that time, this was the capital of Japan.

29
00:03:11,804 --> 00:03:13,532
[Vocab] 都

30
00:03:13,931 --> 00:03:19,379
[Host] It means capital, in the old, classical sense — the seat of the emperor.

31
00:03:19,979 --> 00:03:30,060
[Slow] 飛鳥寺などの古いお寺の跡や、高松塚古墳などの古いお墓も残っています。

32
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:35,996
[Host] The remains of old temples, and old tombs too, still survive here.

33
00:03:36,596 --> 00:03:38,828
[Vocab] 残る

34
00:03:39,228 --> 00:03:46,451
[Host] It means to remain or be left behind. Here, the old ruins are still standing after centuries.

35
00:03:47,051 --> 00:03:53,987
[Slow] 全部で19の資産が、世界遺産の候補です。

36
00:03:54,788 --> 00:04:00,068
[Host] In total, nineteen sites are candidates for World Heritage status.

37
00:04:00,668 --> 00:04:02,828
[Vocab] 候補

38
00:04:03,228 --> 00:04:07,307
[Host] It means candidate — someone or something in the running to be chosen.

39
00:04:07,907 --> 00:04:16,091
[Slow] 正式な登録は、7月に韓国のプサンで決まる見通しです。

40
00:04:16,891 --> 00:04:23,420
[Host] The official registration is expected to be decided in July, in Busan, South Korea.

41
00:04:24,019 --> 00:04:26,180
[Vocab] 決まる

42
00:04:26,579 --> 00:04:32,196
[Host] It means to be decided or settled. It's the partner verb of 'to decide something.'

43
00:04:32,795 --> 00:04:39,372
[Slow] 地元の人たちは、「とてもうれしい」と話しています。

44
00:04:40,172 --> 00:04:43,148
[Host] Local people are saying they're very happy.

45
00:04:43,747 --> 00:04:46,004
[Vocab] 地元

46
00:04:46,403 --> 00:04:51,827
[Host] It means the local area, or one's home turf — the people who live right there.

47
